      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has fallen 17% to ₹32.17. The fair value is estimated to be ₹26.55, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 21% over the last 3 years. Meanwhile, the company became loss making.",
